        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: The Man from Snowy River II, The Man from Snowy River, Miracle of the White Stallions\n- Companies: Walt Disney\n- People: Robert Taylor, Alois Podhajsky, Lilli Palmer, Eddie Albert\n- Organizations: Spanish Riding School\n- Places: Vienna, Australia\n- Events: World War II\n\nFacts:\n- Miracle of the White Stallions is a 1963 film released by Walt Disney.\n- Miracle of the White Stallions stars Robert Taylor as Alois Podhajsky, along with Lilli Palmer and Eddie Albert.\n- Miracle of the White Stallions tells the story of the evacuation of the Lipizzaner horses from the Spanish Riding School in Vienna during World War II.\n- The Man from Snowy River II is a 1988 Australian drama film.\n- The Man from Snowy River II is the sequel to the 1982 film The Man from Snowy River.",
